A '''hyperlane''' ran through the [[Outer Rim Territories]], running from the [[Tangrene system]] south to the [[Edusa system]],<ref name="TFABG" /> then to [[Thabeska]],<ref name="Map" /> on to the [[Vandyne system]],<ref name="TFABG" /> and ending at [[Axxila]], where it joined<ref name="Map" /> the [[Celanon Spur]].<ref name="BMF" />

